            "review_text": "huuloi318\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nDot Drinkery & Kitchen / New Dot / New Experience\nMar 2024 • Solo\nThis bar has a completely new look on 75 Hai Ba Trung Street, the bar is very large and has many areas such as the bar, balcony, main, lougne and billiard room\n\nYou should try drinks with cocktails, mocktails and non-alcoholic drinks if you want\n\nBartender can talking and take care of you all night, don't be afraid to talk frankly with them if you have any questions ;)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 31, 2024",
