            "review_text": "Lloyd L\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat place with unique drinks\nMar 2024 • Friends\nAt Dot drinkery, the staff's warmth and attentive service set the stage for an unforgettable experience. Their genuine hospitality creates a welcoming atmosphere that invites patrons to relax and unwind.\n\nThe drinks at here are top-notch, with expertly crafted cocktails and inventive creations that cater to every taste. Each sip is a testament to the bartenders' skill and dedication.\n\nThis bar excels in providing a friendly environment, great drinks, and welcoming ambiance, making it a must-visit destination for anyone seeking an exceptional bar experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 26, 2024",
